data/austraits_lite.rda (the dataset `austraits_lite`) is a subset of a
different work, with different copyright holders and licence:

  Title:    AusTraits: a curated plant trait database for the Australian flora
  Version:  5.0.0
  DOI:      https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.10156222
  Holders:  the AusTraits contributors, listed in the release and in the
            `contributors` table of the dataset
  Licence:  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
            https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
            The `taxa` table, compiled from curated taxon lists such as the
            Australian Plant Census, is released under CC BY 3.0
            (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/).
  Changes:  cut down to 23 of its datasets with traits.use::extract_dataset(),
            by data-raw/create_data.R in the package's GitHub repository
            (https://github.com/traitecoevo/traits.use).

Please cite AusTraits as: Falster D, Gallagher R, Wenk EH, et al. (2021)
AusTraits, a curated plant trait database for the Australian flora.
Scientific Data 8: 254. https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-021-01006-6
and the original studies, listed in the dataset's `sources`.
